# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Both images build from the repository root, because shared/ is copied into
#  each of them. This keeps the context small without starving those copies.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Dependencies — reinstalled inside the image from the lockfile
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.npm/
npm-debug.log*

# Secrets and local state
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
backend/db/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal

# Version control and editors
.git/
.gitignore
.vscode/
.idea/

# Development-only trees. The web image needs docs/ (the manual is linked from
# the app), so docs/ is NOT excluded — only the tooling around it.
tests/
tools/smoke.js
tools/check-*.js
letsencrypt/
ops/
.github/

# Documentation for developers rather than for the app
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
README.md
.claude/
.agents/
docs/agents/

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
